<article>
	<h1><span>Projects: Activity Comment</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#fields">Fields</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This is where you can edit a comment from the project activity. It opens from the
			<strong>Description</strong> of a comment in the <strong>Activity</strong> list.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="fields">
		<h2><span>Fields</span></h2>

		<h3>Details</h3>
		<dl>
			<dt>Anonymous</dt>
			<dd>When marked anonymous, a commenter's name and picture are hidden. No specific identifying information
				should be accessible by other users.</dd>

			<dt>Comments</dt>
			<dd>The text of the comment, entered in a text editor. Required.</dd>
		</dl>

		<p>The right-hand column shows these, which cannot be changed here:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>ID</dt>
			<dd>The identification number of the entry, assigned by the system.</dd>

			<dt>Creator</dt>
			<dd>The name of the user who created the entry.</dd>

			<dt>Created</dt>
			<dd>The date and time the entry was created.</dd>

			<dt>Action</dt>
			<dd>The action recorded for the entry.</dd>
		</dl>

		<h3>Publishing Options</h3>
		<dl>
			<dt>State</dt>
			<dd>Unpublished, Published or Trashed.</dd>

			<dt>Starred</dt>
			<dd>No or Yes.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Save</dt>
			<dd>Saves the comment and stays on this screen.</dd>

			<dt>Save &amp; Close</dt>
			<dd>Saves the comment and returns to the <strong>Activity</strong> list.</dd>

			<dt>Cancel</dt>
			<dd>Discards any changes and returns to the <strong>Activity</strong> list.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
		<p>Save and Save &amp; Close only appear if you may edit.</p>
	</section>
</article>
